; One variable: whether a Node2D below a break in the CanvasItem chain still inherits the
; transform above it. `get_global_transform` composes through `get_parent_item()`, which casts
; only the direct parent (canvas_item.cpp:565-571), so a plain `Node` link makes a canvas root.
; No Control fixture sees the Node2D walk. `unit-node2d-top-level.tscn` is the flag form.

